---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const exampleManifest = JSON.stringify({
  schemaVersion: 2,
  sdk: { name: "LunaDash", apiVersion: 2 },
  id: "org.example.plugin",
  name: "Example plugin",
  version: "1.0.0",
  type: "quickshell",
  target: "desktop-widgets",
  mode: "augment",
  entry: "Main.qml",
  enabledByDefault: false,
  settings: {}
}, null, 2);
---
<Base title="Submit a plugin" description="How to publish a LunaDash Plugin SDK 2 extension.">
  <section class="docs">
    <span class="eyebrow">Contribute</span>
    <h1>Publish through the registry.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every community plugin enters LunaDash through a pull request to this repository. The runtime manifest is checked by snapshots of LunaDash's own SDK 2 validator, settings schema, and target registry.</p>

    <div class="docs-grid">
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="step">01</span>
        <h2>Start from the SDK template</h2>
        <p>Copy <code>template-plugin/</code>, choose a registered target, and keep the plugin ID equal to its folder name.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="step">02</span>
        <h2>Use schema-driven settings</h2>
        <p>Declare boolean, enum, numeric, slider, or text options in <code>metadata.json</code>. LunaDash generates the controls.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="step">03</span>
        <h2>Submit source only</h2>
        <p>Do not submit built libraries, generated shader packages, object files, archives, or SDK build receipts.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="step">04</span>
        <h2>Pass CI and review</h2>
        <p>Contract validation, source-only checks, PR scope checks, and the Astro build must pass before maintainer review.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <article class="panel manifest-example">
      <h2>Minimal Quickshell manifest</h2>
      <pre><code>{exampleManifest}</code></pre>
    </article>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/LuYishan-4/LunaDash-Plugins/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Full contribution rules</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://github.com/LuYishan-4/LunaDash/tree/fix/plugin/docs/en/PLUGINS.md">LunaDash SDK docs</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
